# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
# Default SPA fallback already ships as web/public/_redirects.
#
# Mode 3 — edge proxy (same-origin). Replace API host, keep status 200,
# and place this file as web/public/_redirects (replaces the SPA-only file):
/api/*  https://API_HOST_REPLACE_ME/api/:splat  200
/healthz  https://API_HOST_REPLACE_ME/healthz  200
/*    /index.html   200
#
# Mode 2 — CDN UI + cross-origin API: keep web/public/_redirects as SPA-only,
# set TM_CORS_ORIGINS=https://*.pages.dev (plus custom domain), and use the
# Server field or VITE_API.
